uired":true,"topics":["bitbucket","cicd","devops","docker-registry-v2","git","git-gui","git-server","gitea","github","github-actions","gitlab","go","golang","hacktoberfest","maven-server","npm-registry","vue"],"visibility":"public","forks":6255,"open_issues":2890,"watchers":52486,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"- Gitea version (or commit ref): 1.14.2\r\n- Git version: 2.30.2\r\n- Operating system: docker with local storage LFS\r\n- Database (use `[x]`):\r\n  - [x] PostgreSQL\r\n  - [ ] MySQL\r\n  - [ ] MSSQL\r\n  - [ ] SQLite\r\n- Can you reproduce the bug at https://try.gitea.io:\r\n  - [ ] Yes (provide example URL)\r\n  - [x] No (**LFS not supported**)\r\n\r\n## Description\r\nThe #15236 \"no commits found\" problem was fixed in 1.14.2.\r\nNow, for certain use cases, the functionality results in an internal error, or the page keeps on loading.\r\nI will give instructions to create a repo that triggers the problem, or just download [lfs-cases.zip](https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/files/6469471/lfs-cases.zip)\r\n\r\nSome notes:\r\n- the cases work fine in 1.13.7\r\n- the files can be committed/pushed in any order, or all together, it always triggers the problem\r\n- the gitea repo does not require special configuration, the problem also appears on a freshly installed instance\r\n\r\n**Case 1: 500 internal error**\r\n```\r\n#!/bin/sh\r\nrm -rf lfs-500 && mkdir lfs-500 && cd lfs-500 && git init\r\ngit lfs track bigfile.txt\r\necho content >> bigfile.txt\r\nmkdir folder\r\necho public class RandomClass {} >> folder/RandomClass.java\r\nmkdir anotherfolder\r\necho public class RandomClassA {} >> anotherfolder/RandomClassA.java\r\ngit add . && git commit -m \"add files\"\r\ngit remote add origin <your-gitea-repo-url>\r\ngit push -u origin --all\r\n```\r\nRepo settings > LFS > \"Find Commits\" result in an internal error. In the logs:\r\n```\r\nrouters/repo/lfs.go:401:LFSFileFind() [E] Failure in FindLFSFile: strconv.ParseInt: parsing \"RandomClass {}\": invalid syntax\r\nrouters/repo/lfs.go:402:LFSFileFind() [E] LFSFind: FindLFSFile.: strconv.ParseInt: parsing \"RandomClass {}\": invalid syntax\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Case 2: page keeps loading**\r\n```\r\n#!/bin/sh\r\nrm -rf lfs-pending && mkdir lfs-pending && cd lfs-pending && git init\r\ngit lfs track bigfile.txt\r\necho content >> bigfile.txt\r\nmkdir folder\r\necho content >> folder/bigfile.txt\r\necho simple >> folder/otherfile.txt\r\nmkdir folder2 && cd folder2 && mkdir subfolder && cd ..\r\necho content >> folder2/bigfile.txt\r\necho fdq >> folder2/subfolder/normalfile.txt\r\ngit add . && git commit -m \"add files\"\r\ngit remote add origin <your-gitea-repo-url>\r\ngit push -u origin --all\r\n```\r\nRepo settings > LFS > \"Find Commits\" keeps loading and the logs show nothing","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/15850/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/15850/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":4844836244,"node_id":"MDExOkxvY2tlZEV2ZW50NDg0NDgzNjI0NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/events/4844836244","actor":{"login":"go-gitea","id":12724356,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEyNzI0MzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12724356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/subscriptions","organizations_url